<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.cappedcat1710.Reeds</id>
  <name>Reeds</name>
  <summary>Read the sites you follow</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Reeds brings the sites and blogs you follow into one calm place. Add a website or feed
      address and Reeds finds the feed, keeps your articles on this device and shows what is new.
    </p>
    <p>
      Read articles with their pictures, star the ones you want to keep, and save others to read
      later. Search everything you have downloaded, group feeds in folders, and bring your feeds
      in from or out to another reader with an OPML file.
    </p>
    <p>
      It works the same on a computer, a tablet and a phone, and everything you read stays on your
      device. There is no account.
    </p>
  </description>
